  Well, I think it's completely pointless to try to make a one-to-one
correspondence between any two languages.  They view the world differently.
 So I don't think there's a "need" to have something just because Ithkuil
or English has it.  That being said, I've interspersed my thoughts below.
 -- gejyspa

